OL,3,GNEWSAHow was an illegal development
OL,4,Acleared so quickly?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs most of the country downed tools on
OL,7,FFriday evening for the bank holiday
OL,8,Fweekend, a group of people picked up
OL,9,Ftools and moved diggers on to open
OL,10,Fspace in a quiet town in Hertfordshire.
OL,12,FThey did not have planning permission.
OL,14,FWhen the same has happened elsewhere in
OL,15,Frecent months, it has taken weeks to
OL,16,Fhalt the builders and get the site
OL,17,Fcleared.
OL,19,FBut by Monday, in Sawbridgeworth, the
OL,20,Fdiggers had left and the work had
OL,21,Fstopped.
